  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Access to Justice</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Access to Justice</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;det till r&#xe4;ttshj&#xe4;lpsfond (Legal Aid Basket Fund) &#xe4;r ett initiative som st&#xf6;ds av fem givare. St&#xf6;det kompletterar det p&#xe5;g&#xe5;ende st&#xf6;det till reformer inom r&#xe4;ttssektorn (JLOS) och f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;tts leda till ett nationellt r&#xe4;ttsst&#xf6;dsprogram hanterat av JLOS. Givare till r&#xe4;ttsst&#xf6;dsfonden &#xe4;t Sverige, &#xd6;sterrike, Danmark, Nederl&#xe4;nderna och Irland. Sveriges har bidragit med 13 MSEK sedan 2006.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Legal Aid Busket Fund (LABF) is an initiative supported 5 development partners with special interest of legal aid service provision. It complements the ongoing Justice, Law and Order Sector, JLOS, reforms and is anticipated to pave way for a national legal aid scheme managed under JLOS. The partners are Sweden, Austria, Denmark, Netherlands and Ireland. Sweden contributed 13 MSEK since 2006</narrative>
  </description>
